es off to get  some coffee when felix attacks  cassie from the shower there's a whole  fight scene where she defends herself  and  rico even comes in and is stabbed but  she's able to get the upper hand and  shoot him but in a surprise twist  cassie's flight attendant partner shane  comes in and performs the finishing blow  in the next scene we find out  shane is cia tasked with keeping tabs on  megan  another flight attendant who is giving a  proprietary technology from her  husband's laptop to the north koreans  yeah it's pretty crazy to be fair megan  didn't know it was going to the north  koreans she thought it was going to a  rival competitor but one thing led to  another and before she knew it she was  in too  deep kind of like what happened to  cassie before cassie's flight to rome  she remarks on how megan's luggage was  so heavy it looked like she was moving  and given megan's heartbreaking call to  her son saying she loves him  we can kind of see where season 2  storyline may pick up  megan is a wanted woman for the  knowledge she gave to the north koreans  and is now on the run and shane having  told cassie his boss wants to talk to  her about becoming a quote human  asset may see cassie becoming some sort  of spy that has to track down megan  in the aftermath of the hotel attack we  find that enrico made it out alive and  so did felix so who knows if he'll come  back in some capacity cassie arrives  back in new york  where she finally patches things up with  her brother apologizes and promises  things are going to be different  she even sits down with her best friend  annie who she had a falling out with a  few episodes ago and cassie shows how  she's been to alcoholics anonymous with  one of her chips  she's already been to two meetings bonus  points if you caught miranda sneaking  the crime and punishment book into  cassie's jacket  at the end of the episode we find out  she's given back alex's book however  this time the page with a bank account  info